# Arrival week
tab:
| Beat | What the files give | Ch. |
| The staggered arrivals | Seven days, one Covenant Daughter a day, each released as its own day of content, each with two Appointed Officers and her House Mother (TR) | _ |
| The Sovereign Bridge | She crosses it and looks up at her own face on the screens, exactly where she planned to be (CR) | _ |
| Day five | She looks at the city first, carries her own bag, and walks the Boulevard at her own pace. The Broadcast uses forty-seven seconds (TR, DOM). | _ |
| In the Palace | Judah watches the footage and sets down whatever he was holding. Three times before he knows why he can't stop (CR). | _ |
| House Aurem | Hannah, Mirielle, Gavin and Abigail (TL) | _ |
