tab:
| Beat | What the files give | Ch. |
| The rankings | Third and fourth become Ladies in Waiting. Delia is one (TR). | _ |
| The Declaration | Live on Sovereign Boulevard. He can choose any of the twelve, deviation is expensive, refusal is abstention (FR 20–22). He chooses Eden (TR). | _ |
| The eleven | Married down the ladder as designated. The two who died, their status back to their families (FR 19, 24). | _ |
| Covenant Week | A Palace residence, the score retired for The Chosen (CR) | _ |
| The Anointing | Day six, the Prelate, oil, unfilmed (CR) | _ |
| The Binding Night | The Emperor's private charge to his son (CR) | _ |
| The Grand Binding | Two hundred feet alone down the Sanctum, vows twice as long as his, the gold cord (CR) | _ |
| The Procession and the Supper | Sovereign Boulevard, then five guests at most (CR) | _ |
small: OPEN QUESTION: The Crownward file calls the Declaration the moment Eden planned for and "the moment that will be taken from her" (CR). What's taken, if she wins?
prompt: The five guests at the Private Supper | fill

